        <SummaryInformation id="998" lang="en">
          <TextSectionList count="1">
            <TextSection id="72783" lang="en">
              <TextSectionType id="16907">
                <Name lang="en">Definition</Name>
              </TextSectionType>
              <Contents>A rare neurodegenerative disorder of the astrocytes comprised of two clinical forms: Alexander disease (AxD) type I and type II manifesting with various degrees of macrocephaly, spasticity, ataxia and seizures and leading to psychomotor regression and death.</Contents>
            </TextSection>
